Description: first-run setup wizard for KDE Plasma
 Plasma Setup greets the owner at the first boot of a new KDE Plasma system,
 before the login manager, and creates the first user account. It also sets
 the language, keyboard layout, time zone and network.
 .
 The wizard runs as the plasma-setup system user when plasma-setup.service is
 enabled and /etc/plasma-setup-done does not exist yet.
